div.p:
—put us out in front and allow Allende to
                    throw the blame for his economic problems on us in the eyes of both his own
                    people and other creditors;

—provide an issue allowing Allende to
                    rally political support and appeal to the opposition and the Armed Forces to
                    show solidarity with the Government out of patriotism;

—participate in the Paris club talks as the President has approved, using them to
                    get the tough multilateral consensus with respect to Chilean debt
                    renegotiation;
